#H
#C(168,005)|Won a City!|
#F015
#L(016,050)|You've won your first city!|
#F007
#L(016,075)|Every time you win a city, a screen|
#L(016,095)|will appear offering you four options.|
#F015
#L(016,120)|Occupy:  Does little damage to the city|
#L(016,140)|and starts you producing immediately.|
#F007
#L(016,165)|Pillage:  Earns you a little money but|
#L(016,185)|does some damage to the city too!|
#F015
#L(016,210)|Sack:  Earns much more money than pillaging|
#L(016,230)|but does much more damage too!|
#F007
#L(016,255)|Raze:  Completely destroys the city.|
#L(016,275)|It can never be rebuilt.|
#F015
#L(016,300)|Usually "Occupy" is the best option.|
